{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/vue-virtual"},{"type":"text","value":" adapter is a wrapper around the core virtual logic."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"usevirtualizer","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useVirtualizer"}]},{"type":"code","value":"function useVirtualizer<TScrollElement, TItemElement = unknown>(\n  options: PartialKeys<\n    VirtualizerOptions<TScrollElement, TItemElement>,\n    'observeElementRect' | 'observeElementOffset' | 'scrollToFn'\n  >,\n): Virtualizer<TScrollElement, TItemElement>","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This function returns a standard "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Virtualizer"},{"type":"text","value":" instance configured to work with an HTML element as the scrollElement."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"usewindowvirtualizer","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useWindowVirtualizer"}]},{"type":"code","value":"function useWindowVirtualizer<TItemElement = unknown>(\n  options: PartialKeys<\n    VirtualizerOptions<Window, TItemElement>,\n    | 'getScrollElement'\n    | 'observeElementRect'\n    | 'observeElementOffset'\n    | 'scrollToFn'\n  >,\n): Virtualizer<Window, TItemElement>","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This function returns a window-based "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Virtualizer"},{"type":"text","value":" instance configured to work with the window as the scrollElement."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"usevirtualizer","text":"useVirtualizer","level":2},{"id":"usewindowvirtualizer","text":"useWindowVirtualizer","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nThe `@tanstack/vue-virtual` adapter is a wrapper around the core virtual logic.\n\n## `useVirtualizer`\n\n```tsx\nfunction useVirtualizer<TScrollElement, TItemElement = unknown>(\n  options: PartialKeys<\n    VirtualizerOptions<TScrollElement, TItemElement>,\n    'observeElementRect' | 'observeElementOffset' | 'scrollToFn'\n  >,\n): Virtualizer<TScrollElement, TItemElement>\n```\n\nThis function returns a standard `Virtualizer` instance configured to work with an HTML element as the scrollElement.\n\n## `useWindowVirtualizer`\n\n```tsx\nfunction useWindowVirtualizer<TItemElement = unknown>(\n  options: PartialKeys<\n    VirtualizerOptions<Window, TItemElement>,\n    | 'getScrollElement'\n    | 'observeElementRect'\n    | 'observeElementOffset'\n    | 'scrollToFn'\n  >,\n): Virtualizer<Window, TItemElement>\n```\n\nThis function returns a window-based `Virtualizer` instance configured to work with the window as the scrollElement.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: Vue Virtual\n---\n\nThe `@tanstack/vue-virtual` adapter is a wrapper around the core virtual logic.\n\n## `useVirtualizer`\n\n```tsx\nfunction useVirtualizer<TScrollElement, TItemElement = unknown>(\n  options: PartialKeys<\n    VirtualizerOptions<TScrollElement, TItemElement>,\n    'observeElementRect' | 'observeElementOffset' | 'scrollToFn'\n  >,\n): Virtualizer<TScrollElement, TItemElement>\n```\n\nThis function returns a standard `Virtualizer` instance configured to work with an HTML element as the scrollElement.\n\n## `useWindowVirtualizer`\n\n```tsx\nfunction useWindowVirtualizer<TItemElement = unknown>(\n  options: PartialKeys<\n    VirtualizerOptions<Window, TItemElement>,\n    | 'getScrollElement'\n    | 'observeElementRect'\n    | 'observeElementOffset'\n    | 'scrollToFn'\n  >,\n): Virtualizer<Window, TItemElement>\n```\n\nThis function returns a window-based `Virtualizer` instance configured to work with the window as the scrollElement.\n"}
